# Welcome to your pod

This is **your** space. You created it, and — unlike most apps — you own the data
in it, not us.

## What's here already

- **`profile/card`** — your identity document (your "WebID"). Apps use it to know
  who you are. It's public on purpose: identity has to be checkable by anyone,
  the same way a phone number has to be dialable. Nothing else about you is.
- **This pod's top level** is *listable* — anyone who knows its address can see
  the *names* of what's here — but not read inside anything. New things you add
  start fully private, visible to no one but you, until you choose to share them.

## Sharing, on your terms

Open the backoffice app, tap the badge next to anything, and pick who can see
it: nobody, or anyone with the link. There's no in-between tier yet — that's
coming.

## If you connect an app or a bot to this pod

A connected app acts *as you* — it can do whatever you can do here. Give it a
name you'll recognise, and revoke it the moment you're done with it. Revoking
is instant and there's no limit to how many times you do it.

